# No `# expect:`: the two compilers word this differently and `make test` scores the
# expectation against ./tychoc1. Bootstrap src/tychoc.c:3513 says `expected a value
# after '..' in the match arm`; tychoc1 stops one rule earlier, at `a match arm must
# be a variant name, a scalar literal, a range, or `_``. See plan.md R21d-2.
fn main():
    x := 1
    match x:
        1: println("a")
        2.."z": println("c")
        _: println("b")
